How many questions can each model handle before Astra?
We replayed recorded answers on the 2,198 questions. The first model answers the questions it
is most confident about; GPT-6 Astra · low · chat answers the rest. We choose the cutoff on
half the questions and test it on the other half; bars show the average over 300 splits.

